# Files prettier must not rewrite.
#
# `make preflight` runs `prettier --write`, so anything listed here would
# otherwise be reformatted on every run — showing up as an unrelated diff in
# whatever branch happens to be checked out, which nobody then commits, so it
# comes back on the next run.

# Hand-authored release prose. Entries are written by whoever ships the change
# and prettier normalises their emphasis markers (*focused* -> _focused_),
# producing a phantom diff on every preflight. The formatting of a changelog
# carries no engineering value; leave it as written.
CHANGELOG.md

# npm owns this file's formatting. Prettier's output happens to match today, but
# any divergence would turn every `npm install` into a formatting conflict.
package-lock.json
